  "Id": "a939eda2-b435-590f-824b-85ca030dc2cd"/*VolumeNanoVdbFireExample*/,
  "Description": "A flame rendered from a NanoVDB level set.\n\nA capsule is displaced by animated [VolumeNoise]. [NanoVdbRender] maps the depth below its surface to temperature, so the core glows hotter than the edge. Liquid and smoke are switched off.\n\nAKA: flame, emissive volume, torch\n\nTips\n- FireSoftness is the depth over which the flame goes from cool to hottest; FireIntensity scales its brightness.",
